### Update Profile
PUT http://localhost:3001/api/auth/profile
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "full_name": "John Updated",
  "phone": "0987654321",
  "date_of_birth": "2000-05-20"
}
### Invalid Profile
PUT http://localhost:3001/api/auth/profile
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "full_name": "",
  "phone": "123456789012345678901",
  "date_of_birth": "2026-02-30"
}
### Unauthorized Update
PUT http://localhost:3001/api/auth/profile
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "full_name": "Test User",
  "phone": "0123456789",
  "date_of_birth": "2000-05-20"
}

